# Commits of the comparisons in go/compare, read by run_compare.sh. See go/compare/README.md.

# Reference of the exact and the statistical comparison. It moves at the end of each phase, and in phase 3 after
# each fix. Until step F0 is merged it is the fork point (gobees), which writes only the 15 columns of DailyOutput.
# After the merge of F0: set it to the merge commit of F0, so that all columns are compared.
REFERENCE_COMMIT=40dc301

# Base of the speed comparison: the fork point, i.e. gobees. Stays fixed.
BASE_COMMIT=40dc301

# Comparisons that must pass in the current phase (-run pattern of go test). Phase 1: exact and statistical.
# Phase 2 and 3: the exact comparison fails by design, set it to 'Statistical|Speed'.
COMPARE_TESTS='Exact|Statistical|Speed'
